    {
      "id": "b1xnqdh",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "IPv6 Key Features"
    },
    {
      "id": "nt9zqv1",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "128-bit address space (vs 32-bit IPv4); 340 undecillion addresses",
        "Written as 8 groups of 4 hex digits: 2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370:7334",
        "No broadcast; uses multicast and anycast instead",
        "Built-in IPsec support; auto-configuration (SLAAC)",
        "Header simplified (40 bytes fixed); extension headers for options"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "comparisonTable",
      "headers": [
